Package: dv-launcher
Version: 1.0.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Digital Vigital <contact@digitalvigital.com>
Homepage: https://digitalvigital.com
Description: High-performance, minimal, and privacy-first Minecraft launcher in native Rust
 Digital Vigital (DV) is an ultra-fast, native Minecraft launcher written in
 Rust with a sleek Slint GUI. It offers direct JVM launching, background RAM
 minimization on game start, isolated mod profile management, and zero telemetry.
